register" class="panel_button register_button" data-register_action="header" href="/register">Register</a></div></div><div class="header_dropdown" data-target="browse"><a href="/games/store">Indie game store</a><a href="/games/free">Free games</a><a href="/games/fun">Fun games</a><a href="/games/tag-horror">Horror games</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/tools">Game development</a><a href="/game-assets">Assets</a><a href="/comics">Comics</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/sales">Sales</a><a href="/bundles">Bundles</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/jobs">Jobs</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/tags">Tags</a><a href="/game-development/engines">Game Engines</a></div></div><div class="jam_page_wrap" id="wrapper"><div class="view_jam_page view_jam_base_page page_widget base_widget view_jam_default before_start has_banner" id="view_jam_2239516"><div class="jam_banner_outer"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4MDY3NDQ3LnBuZw==/original/Z1%2BVgd.png" class="jam_banner "/></div><div class="jam_body"><div class="jam_header_widget base_widget" id="jam_header_2143922"><div class="header_inner"><div class="header_columns"><div class="title_colum"><h1 class="jam_title_header"><a href="/jam/do-you-wanna-jam-2026">Do you WANNA Jam?! 2026</a></h1><div class="jam_host_header">Hosted by <a href="https://wannibemanisha.itch.io">Manisha W</a> · <a href="https://bsky.app/hashtag/wannajam">#wannajam</a></div></div><div class="stats_container"><div class="stat_box"><div class="stat_value">472</div><div class="stat_label">Joined</div></div></div></div><div class="header_tabs"><a class="header_tab active" data-label="tab_view_jam" href="/jam/do-you-wanna-jam-2026">Overview</a><div class="tab_group"><a class="header_tab" href="/jam/do-you-wanna-jam-2026/community">Community</a><span class="community_activity">11</span></div></div></div></div><div class="submitter_outer"><div class="jam_submitter_widget base_widget before_start" id="jam_submitter_2911308"><div class="date_data">Submissions open from <span data-format="MMMM Do YYYY [at] h:mm A" class="date_format">2026-08-15 14:00:00</span> to <span data-format="MMMM Do YYYY [at] h:mm A" class="date_format">2026-08-24 14:00:00</span></div><div class="countdown"><span class="countdown_label">Starts in</span><div class="times"><div data-name="years" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">years</div></div><div data-name="months" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">months</div></div><div data-name="days" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">days</div></div><div data-name="hours" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">hours</div></div><div data-name="minutes" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">minutes</div></div><div data-name="seconds" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">seconds</div></div></div></div><div class="state_action"><button data-href="/jam/417297/join" class="button fat submitter_button join_jam_btn" data-method="post">Join jam</button></div></div></div><div class="jam_content user_formatted"><p>Hey! I&#x27;m Manisha and I run a little game dev channel called <a target="_blank" href="https://www.youtube.com/@WannibeManisha" style="" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">Wannibe Manisha</a> where I share devlogs about the games I make. Join us for a friendly game jam this summer and show everyone what you&#x27;ve got!! :)</p>
<div class="text-center"><iframe height="281" width="500" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/I6vzPI99mSw" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen=""></iframe></div>
<p><br></p>
<h2>Timeline</h2>
<p>This is a 9-day game jam spanning from August 15th to August 24th. Please note the timestamps above -this is when the jam will start at your local time.&nbsp; After the jam period, there will be a one-week voting period where you can play everyone&#x27;s games and rank them.
</p>
<h2>Eligibility &amp; Rules</h2>
<p>This game jam is open to everyone of all ages and all team sizes. Use this opportunity to meet new people, collaborate with friends on a cool project, or work on that solo project you&#x27;ve been daydreaming about! You can use any game engine to make your game. Free assets and assets obtained legally are allowed to be used in your submission.&nbsp;&nbsp;
</p>
<p>We encourage you not to use artifical intelligence and/or generative AI in your game submissions. However, we are only able to monitor the use of AI generated images, graphics and audio assets. The game jam exists to encourage collaboration and refining our game dev skills.
</p>
<h2>Theme</h2>
<p>The theme will be announced the morning of Day 1! Stay tuned.</p>
<h2>Voting Criteria</h2>
<p>Voting criteria are a good reminder of what to focus on for your submission. Voting is open to the public. Here are the categories that all participants will be able to vote and be ranked on:
</p>
<ul><li><strong>Fun:</strong> How much did you enjoy playing the game?
</li><li><strong>Art/Graphics:</strong> How good does the game looks visually? Simplicity and charm count!&nbsp;
</li><li><strong>Audio:</strong> How good are the music and sound effects? Was it complementary to the game?
</li><li><strong>Theme:</strong> How well was the theme added into the game?
</li><li><strong>Originality:</strong> Was there something unique about the game?&nbsp;
</li></ul>
<h2>Resources</h2>
<p>I am a big fan of using the HeatleyBros music for my games and videos. Do check out their <a target="_blank" href="https://www.youtube.com/@HeatleyBros" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">Youtube channel</a> and a specially prepared <a target="_blank" href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1C9UIL0cf8Ha5xMIyrMJn9aVAxaCDTEjE" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">catalog</a> of iconic tunes!&nbsp;
</p>
<h2>Join our Communities</h2>
<p>If you have any questions or need to find a team, join our discords or make a post on the community tab of the jam page.&nbsp;
</p>
<p><a target="_blank" href="https://discord.com/invite/NWPNtW8NdA" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">Manisha&#x27;s Discord</a>
</p>
<p><a target="_blank" href="https://www.youtube.com/c/WannibeManisha" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">Wannibe Manisha&#x27;s Youtube</a>&nbsp;
</p>
<p><a target="_blank" href="https://twitter.com/manisha_gamedev" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">Manisha&#x27;s Twitter</a>
</p>
<p><a href="https://www.instagram.com/wannibestudios/" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">Manisha&#x27;s Instagram</a>
</p>
<p>Share your progress on Twitter with #wannajam&nbsp;
</p>
<p><br></p></div></div><script type="text/template" id="add_game_to_jam_lightbox_tpl"><div tabIndex="-1" class="add_game_to_jam_lightbox_widget lightbox_widget base_widget  force_login has_fields lightbox" id="add_game_to_jam_lightbox_1274689" role="dialog"><button class="close_button"><svg class="svgicon icon_cross2" stroke="currentColor" width="18" height="18" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden fill="none" stroke-width="2" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 24 24" role="img"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line></svg></button><h2>Log in to continue</h2><p>This jam is using <a target="_blank" href="http://itch.io">itch.io</a> to host entries. You&#039;ll need to register or log in on
      itch.io in order to <span class="on_submit">submit your game</span><span class="on_join">join this jam</span>.</p><p class="on_submit">After signing in you can create a new game on itch.io then
      return here and click the <em>submit game</em> button again to enter your game.</p><p><a class="button" data-register_action="jam_submit" href="/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fdo-you-wanna-jam-2026&amp;intent=jam_submit">Log in</a><span class="or_split"> or </span><a class="button" data-register_action="jam_submit" href="/register?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fdo-you-wanna-jam-2026&amp;intent=jam_submit">Register</a></p></div></script></div></div><script type="text/template" id="loading_lightbox_tpl"><div aria-live="polite" class="lightbox loading_lightbox"><div class="loader_outer"><div class="loader_label">Loading</div><div class="loader_bar"><div class="loader_bar_slider"></div></div></div></div></script><script type="text/javascript">new I.ViewJam('#view_jam_2239516', {"voting_end_date":"2026-08-31 14:00:00","id":417297,"end_date":"2026-08-24 14:00:00","start_date":"2026-08-15 14:00:00"});init_JamLayoutHeader('#jam_layout_header_9234652', {"autocomplete_props":{"i18n":{"search":"Search","search_placeholder":"Search for games, jams, tags or creators"},"ca_source":25,"ca_types":{"featured_tag":7,"browse_facet":8,"game":1,"jam":4,"bundle":6},"autocomplete_url":"\/autocomplete","search_url":"\/search"}});
